{"lesson":{"id":"dilution_c1v1","title":"Nouvelle concentration après dilution","language":"fr","learning_goal":"Comprendre que diluer ne change pas la quantité de soluté, d'où C₁V₁ = C₂V₂, et trouver la nouvelle concentration."},"math_context":{"symbols":{"C1":{"kind":"constant","value":0.6},"V1":{"kind":"constant","value":0.025},"V2":{"kind":"constant","value":0.15}},"expressions":{"n1":"C1*V1","c2":"C1*V1/V2","facteur":"V2/V1"}}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_quantite","introduces":[{"id":"avant","type":"polygon","params":{"vertices":[[0,0],[3,0],[3,2],[0,2]]},"style":{"role":"given"}},{"id":"apres","type":"polygon","params":{"vertices":[[0,0],[9,0],[9,2],[0,2]]},"style":{"role":"unknown"}},{"id":"p1","type":"point","params":{"at":[0.8,1.3]},"frame":"avant"},{"id":"p2","type":"point","params":{"at":[1.6,0.6]},"frame":"avant"},{"id":"p3","type":"point","params":{"at":[2.3,1.5]},"frame":"avant"},{"id":"p4","type":"point","params":{"at":[0.7,0.5]},"frame":"avant"},{"id":"p5","type":"point","params":{"at":[2.0,0.8]},"frame":"avant"},{"id":"q1","type":"point","params":{"at":[1.6,1.3]},"frame":"apres"},{"id":"q2","type":"point","params":{"at":[4.8,0.6]},"frame":"apres"},{"id":"q3","type":"point","params":{"at":[6.9,1.5]},"frame":"apres"},{"id":"q4","type":"point","params":{"at":[2.1,0.5]},"frame":"apres"},{"id":"q5","type":"point","params":{"at":[6.0,0.8]},"frame":"apres"},{"id":"n1","type":"math","content":"n = 0{,}60 \\times 0{,}025 = 0{,}015\\ \\text{mol}","parts":[{"id":"n_mot","text":"n ="},{"id":"n_calc","text":"0{,}60 \\times 0{,}025"},{"id":"n_res","text":"= 0{,}015\\ \\text{mol}"}],"layout":{"next_to":"avant","direction":"down","gap":"lg"}}],"beats":[{"id":"dessin","say":"Je te dessine la solution de départ : le grand rectangle, c'est la solution, et chaque point, c'est une particule de soluté.","cues":[{"id":"c_rectangle","text":"grand rectangle"},{"id":"c_point","text":"chaque point"}],"do":[{"id":"d_avant","verb":"draw","target":"avant","at":"cue:c_rectangle"},{"id":"s_p1","verb":"show","target":"p1","at":"cue:c_point"},{"id":"s_p2","verb":"show","target":"p2","at":"after:s_p1"},{"id":"s_p3","verb":"show","target":"p3","at":"after:s_p2"},{"id":"s_p4","verb":"show","target":"p4","at":"after:s_p3"},{"id":"s_p5","verb":"show","target":"p5","at":"after:s_p4"}]},{"id":"calcule","say":"Vingt-cinq millilitres, c'est zéro virgule zéro deux cinq litre. À zéro virgule soixante mole par litre, il y a zéro virgule zéro quinze mole de soluté.","cues":[{"id":"c_volume","text":"zéro virgule zéro deux cinq litre"},{"id":"c_mole","text":"zéro virgule zéro quinze mole"}],"do":[{"id":"w_mot","verb":"write","target":"n1","part":"n_mot","at":"cue:c_volume"},{"id":"w_calc","verb":"write","target":"n1","part":"n_calc","at":"after:w_mot"},{"id":"w_res","verb":"write","target":"n1","part":"n_res","at":"cue:c_mole"}],"pause_after":"normal"}]}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_dilution","introduces":[{"id":"meme","type":"text","content":"Même nombre de points : la quantité de soluté ne change pas.","layout":{"next_to":"n1","direction":"down","gap":"lg"}}],"beats":[{"id":"ajoute","say":"J'ajoute de l'eau jusqu'à cent cinquante millilitres. Le rectangle devient plus large : les mêmes particules ont maintenant beaucoup plus de place.","cues":[{"id":"c_ajoute","text":"jusqu'à cent cinquante millilitres"},{"id":"c_meme","text":"les mêmes particules"}],"do":[{"id":"d_apres","verb":"draw","target":"apres","at":"cue:c_ajoute"},{"id":"s_q1","verb":"show","target":"q1","at":"cue:c_meme"},{"id":"s_q2","verb":"show","target":"q2","at":"after:s_q1"},{"id":"s_q3","verb":"show","target":"q3","at":"after:s_q2"},{"id":"s_q4","verb":"show","target":"q4","at":"after:s_q3"},{"id":"s_q5","verb":"show","target":"q5","at":"after:s_q4"},{"id":"w_meme","verb":"write","target":"meme","at":"after:s_q5"}],"pause_after":"normal"}]}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_formule","introduces":[{"id":"regle","type":"math","content":"C_1 V_1 = C_2 V_2","parts":[{"id":"gauche","text":"C_1 V_1"},{"id":"droite","text":"= C_2 V_2"}]},{"id":"calc","type":"math","content":"C_2 = \\frac{0{,}015}{0{,}15} = 0{,}10\\ \\text{mol/L}","parts":[{"id":"c2_num","text":"\\frac{0{,}015}{0{,}15}"},{"id":"c2_val","text":"= 0{,}10\\ \\text{mol/L}"}]}],"beats":[{"id":"regle_dit","say":"Comme la quantité de soluté ne change pas, la concentration fois le volume du départ égale la concentration fois le volume à la fin. C'est la relation de dilution.","cues":[{"id":"c_gauche","text":"la concentration fois le volume du départ"},{"id":"c_droite","text":"concentration fois le volume à la fin"}],"do":[{"id":"w_gauche","verb":"write","target":"regle","part":"gauche","at":"cue:c_gauche"},{"id":"w_droite","verb":"write","target":"regle","part":"droite","at":"cue:c_droite"},{"id":"h_gauche","verb":"highlight","target":"regle","part":"gauche","role":"given","start":"cue:c_gauche","end":"cue_end:c_gauche"}],"pause_after":"normal"},{"id":"isole","say":"On connaît C un, V un et V deux. On divise zéro virgule zéro quinze mole par zéro virgule quinze litre : ça donne zéro virgule dix mole par litre.","cues":[{"id":"c_connait","text":"C un, V un et V deux"},{"id":"c_quinze","text":"zéro virgule zéro quinze mole"},{"id":"c_un","text":"zéro virgule dix mole par litre"}],"do":[{"id":"d_meme","verb":"dim","target":"meme","at":"cue:c_connait"},{"id":"d_n1","verb":"dim","target":"n1","at":"cue:c_connait"},{"id":"w_num","verb":"write","target":"calc","part":"c2_num","at":"cue:c_quinze"},{"id":"w_val","verb":"write","target":"calc","part":"c2_val","at":"cue:c_un"}],"pause_after":"normal"}]}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_pourquoi","introduces":[{"id":"dimin","type":"text","content":"Le volume est six fois plus grand, la concentration est six fois plus petite : 0,60 → 0,10 mol/L","layout":{"next_to":"calc","direction":"down","gap":"lg"}}],"beats":[{"id":"raison","say":"Le volume a été multiplié par six : cent cinquante divisé par vingt-cinq. Le soluté s'est réparti dans six fois plus d'espace.","cues":[{"id":"c_six","text":"par six"},{"id":"c_espace","text":"six fois plus d'espace"}],"do":[{"id":"s_dimin","verb":"show","target":"dimin","at":"cue:c_espace"},{"id":"h_val","verb":"highlight","target":"calc","part":"c2_val","role":"result","start":"cue:c_espace","end":"cue_end:c_espace"}],"pause_after":"normal"},{"id":"erreur","say":"Attention à l'erreur classique : multiplier la concentration par le rapport des volumes ferait huit mole par litre. Mais on dilue, donc la concentration diminue, elle ne peut pas augmenter.","cues":[{"id":"c_erreur","text":"huit mole par litre"},{"id":"c_diminue","text":"la concentration diminue"}],"do":[{"id":"h_droite","verb":"highlight","target":"regle","part":"droite","role":"accent","start":"cue:c_erreur","end":"cue_end:c_erreur"}],"pause_after":"long"}]}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_retenir","introduces":[{"id":"idee","type":"text","content":"Diluer : même quantité de soluté, plus de volume, donc C₁V₁ = C₂V₂ et la concentration baisse.","layout":{"center_on":"calc"}}],"beats":[{"id":"retenir","say":"À retenir : diluer, c'est ajouter du solvant sans ajouter de soluté. La quantité de soluté ne change pas, le volume augmente, donc la concentration diminue.","cues":[{"id":"c_retenir","text":"À retenir"},{"id":"c_quantite","text":"La quantité de soluté ne change pas"}],"do":[{"id":"r_avant","verb":"fade_out","target":"avant","at":"cue:c_retenir"},{"id":"r_apres","verb":"fade_out","target":"apres","at":"cue:c_retenir"},{"id":"r_regle","verb":"fade_out","target":"regle","at":"cue:c_retenir"},{"id":"r_calc","verb":"fade_out","target":"calc","at":"cue:c_retenir"},{"id":"r_dimin","verb":"fade_out","target":"dimin","at":"cue:c_retenir"},{"id":"s_idee","verb":"show","target":"idee","at":"cue:c_quantite"}]}]}}
